  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 率\ntitle: rate; lead; frank\njlpt: 1\ntags: [jlpt-n1, grade-5, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 11\nradical: 玄\nradicalNumber: 95\nonyomi: [ソツ, リツ, シュツ]\nkunyomi: [ひき.いる]\nquizOnyomi: [ソツ, リツ]\nquizKunyomi: []\ndistractors: [卒, 律, 栗]\nquiz_exclusions: [比, 割, 令, 命, 将, 導, 直]\n---\n\n# 率 — rate; lead; frank\n\n**Strokes:** 11 · **Key (radical):** 玄 (no. 95) · **JLPT:** N1 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n率 is a rate, read リツ, and also leading or being plain-spoken, read ソツ; the verb 率いる ひきいる means to lead. [率](../words/率.md) りつ is a rate or proportion, [率直](../words/率直.md) そっちょく is frank or candid, [確率](../words/確率.md) かくりつ is probability and [能率](../words/能率.md) のうりつ is efficiency. JMdict glosses the noun 率 りつ, which is also used as a suffix, \"rate; ratio; proportion; percentage.\"\n\nThe Daijisen character entry splits the readings. For ソツ it gives four senses: leading a whole group, as in 率先 そっせん, \"taking the initiative,\" 引率 いんそつ, \"leading; guiding; commanding,\" and 統率 とうそつ, \"command; lead; generalship; leadership\"; following, as in 率由 そつゆう, \"following (a precedent, former example, etc.)\"; being as-is, as in 率直 and 真率 しんそつ, \"honesty; sincerity; frankness\"; and suddenness, as in 軽率 けいそつ, \"rash; thoughtless; careless; hasty; imprudent.\" For リツ it gives one sense, the share of a part against the whole, as in 比率 ひりつ, \"ratio; proportion; percentage,\" 勝率 しょうりつ, \"winning percentage,\" 税率 ぜいりつ, \"tax rate,\" and 百分率 ひゃくぶんりつ, \"percentage.\"\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** find 玄 at the top centre, a pair of small strokes on each side of it, and [十](十.md), \"ten,\" at the bottom. Imagine a leader at the top with a small stroke on each side like followers, standing above a ten-mark that counts out the rate. This is a memory aid only: it makes no claim that 玄 or 十 contributes meaning or sound. Historical formation is not established here.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ソツ | on | [率直](../words/率直.md) そっちょく — frank; candid |\n| リツ | on | [率](../words/率.md) りつ — rate; proportion; [確率](../words/確率.md) かくりつ — probability; likelihood; [能率](../words/能率.md) のうりつ — efficiency; work rate |\n| シュツ | on, source-only here | Listed in KANJIDIC2; the しゅつ of 出塁率 しゅつるいりつ belongs to 出 and does not establish this reading of 率 |\n| ひき.いる | kun | 率いる ひきいる - to lead; to spearhead (a group); to command (troops); no word article yet, not selected for questions here |\n\nIn 率直, 率 supplies ソツ, which shortens to そっ before チョク, the reading of 直. In 確率, 確 supplies カク, and in 能率, 能 supplies ノウ; 率 stays リツ in both, and the word 率 on its own is りつ. In 率いる, 率 writes ひき and いる is okurigana, the kana ending that follows the kanji.\n\nThe official Joyo table, the list of standard-use readings, shows ソツ, with 率先, 引率 and 軽率 as examples; リツ, with 比率, 能率 and 百分率; and ひきいる, with 率いる. シュツ is not in the official table. Practice selects ソツ and リツ, the readings with linked word articles; ひき.いる is retained from KANJIDIC2 and illustrated with a dictionary word, and シュツ has no verified example here. Being outside the practice set is not proof that a reading is invalid.\n\n## Common words\n\n- [率](../words/率.md) りつ — rate; proportion\n- [率直](../words/率直.md) そっちょく — frank; candid\n- [確率](../words/確率.md) かくりつ — probability; likelihood\n- [能率](../words/能率.md) のうりつ — efficiency; work rate\n\n## Notes\n\n- The other kanji in the common words are [直](直.md), \"direct; repair,\" in 率直, [確](確.md), \"certain,\" in 確率 and [能](能.md), \"ability; capacity,\" in 能率. The word 率 contains only this kanji.\n- [卒](卒.md), \"graduate; finish,\" also has 十 at the bottom and is also read ソツ and シュツ; JMdict lists 卒 in the rarely used spellings 軽卒 and 卒直 of 軽率 and 率直. [律](律.md), \"law; rhythm,\" and [栗](栗.md), \"chestnut,\" are also read リツ. All are different kanji.\n- [比](比.md), \"compare; ratio,\" [割](割.md), \"split; proportion,\" [令](令.md), \"command; decree,\" [命](命.md), \"life; command,\" [将](将.md), \"commander; impending,\" [導](導.md), \"guide; conduct,\" and [直](直.md), \"direct; repair,\" overlap the senses \"ratio,\" \"proportion,\" \"command,\" \"lead\" and \"direct\" that 率 and its words carry; 将 also has the kun reading ひきい.る, and 直 appears in 率直. They are kept out of this card's quiz options. Do not treat \"rate\" or \"lead\" as exclusive to any one character.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-11-02 snapshot. Word identities and spelling restrictions: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1551200, 1596570, 1205950, 1470330, 1551210, 1596560, 1169710, 1449840, 2841579, 1364410, 1252910, 1483680, 1706730, 1382210, 1488450 and 1928380. Character reading and compounds: [Digital Daijisen, 率](https://www.weblio.jp/content/率).\n\nUsage evidence: [Official Joyo kanji table (2010), PDF p. 101](https://www.bunka.go.jp/kokugo_nihongo/sisaku/joho/joho/kijun/naikaku/pdf/joyokanjihyo_20101130.pdf#page=101).\n",
